## Human Gates (cannot be automated)

The following actions always require explicit human approval before Claude proceeds:

1. Any change to this CLAUDE.md — requires Tech Lead approval
2. Adding a new approved dependency — requires Tech Lead approval
3. Any database schema migration — requires Tech Lead review
4. Any change to auth or security-related code — requires security review
5. Releasing to production — requires QA sign-off and PM approval
6. Creating a new platform adapter — requires Architect approval

