## Escalation Path

If you are blocked and cannot reach the required approver:

1. Create a blocking issue in the project tracker with label `platform-guardian-block`
2. Tag {{PM_NAME}} and {{TECH_LEAD_NAME}}
3. Do not attempt to bypass the block — document it instead
4. For production incidents only: use `guardian emergency-bypass --reason "<reason>"` which logs
   the bypass and notifies {{TECH_LEAD_NAME}} immediately

